/pipavlo82/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipavlo82/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"V3 independently replays the preserved v2 results and adds externally published Nostr/EIP-712 artifacts, native zkIE replay, a typed claim-obligation planner and a local execution record checked through ReceiptOS/Crystal.\n\nStatus: **PARTIAL_CHAIN_VERIFIED**. Four narrow positive claims do not establish a complete external WYRIWE → zkIE → judgment → execution chain. Exact missing admission, authority, binding and execution evidence is documented with an executable acquisition plan.\n\nValidation: 36 scenarios, 19 tests per normal/repeat/optimized run, three external signatures cross-checked by Node/Python, 14 isolated source mutations killed and zero survived/crashed. The same-evidence component baseline falsely authorizes 21/32 negative/unsupported requests; explicit composition authorizes 0/32. Six unavailable integration boundaries remain outside mutation coverage. Historical v2 18/2 and follow-up 2/0 evidence remain unchanged.\n\nIncludes the formal model, prior-art analysis, academic paper draft, source/byte locks, raw command logs and pinned CI. No upstream vulnerability, general security guarantee or novelty claim is made.\n\nThis branch is based on unmerged draft PR #2 at 653b8e92e56afb99797c04b1c616a6d7fb3555e9; the main diff therefore includes that dependency. Review v3-only changes from that SHA. Keep this PR draft; do not merge automatically.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-17T02:53:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T02:53:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6762bb4b0d354198a3f5162a9656e2c9889a4791","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pipavlo82:research/complete-real-evidence-chain-v3","ref":"research/complete-real-evidence-chain-v3","repo":{"id":1422280233,"